flowchart LR
    U[Authenticated User] 
    XAPI[Cloud Journey XAPI] 
    CA[Custom Authorizer] 
    API[APM / Role API] 
    A[Allow] 
    D[Deny] 
    U --> XAPI 
    XAPI --> CA 
    CA -->|User ID / Email + APM ID| API 
    API -->|Role + Role Type + Scope| CA 
    CA -->|Authorized| A 
    CA -->|Unauthorized| D